---
layout: layout.njk
title: "Contact"
description: "Book a twenty-minute technology conversation with Dealer Flywheel. No deck, no pitch."
permalink: /contact/
---
<div class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Start with a conversation</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);">Twenty minutes, no deck, no pitch.</h1>
    <p class="sub">Walk us through what happens to a lead from the moment it arrives. That conversation usually surfaces two or three problems worth fixing, and you'll know within twenty minutes whether the Dealership Technology Diagnostic is worth $1,500 to you.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="ctagrid" style="align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <div id="booking" class="booking-wrap">
          <div class="booking-date-row">
            <label class="booking-label" for="booking-date">Pick a date</label>
            <input type="date" id="booking-date" class="booking-date-input">
          </div>
          <div id="booking-slots" class="booking-slots">
            <p class="disclaim">Choose a date to see open times.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="booking-form-wrap" class="booking-form-wrap" hidden>
            <button type="button" id="booking-back" class="booking-back">&larr; Choose a different time</button>
            <p class="booking-summary" id="booking-summary"></p>
            <form id="booking-form" class="booking-form">
              <input type="hidden" id="booking-date-hidden" name="bookingDate">
              <input type="hidden" id="booking-time" name="bookingTime">
              <!-- spam trap: hidden from people. Deliberately given a name and label that
              browser autofill won't recognize, so autofill never fills it. -->
              <div class="booking-hp" aria-hidden="true">
                <label for="booking-hpx">Leave this field empty</label>
                <input type="text" id="booking-hpx" name="hp_x9" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" data-lpignore="true" data-1p-ignore>
              </div>
              <label class="booking-label" for="booking-name">Name</label>
              <input class="booking-input" type="text" id="booking-name" name="name" required>
              <label class="booking-label" for="booking-email">Email</label>
              <input class="booking-input" type="email" id="booking-email" name="email" required>
              <label class="booking-label" for="booking-phone">Phone <span class="booking-optional">(optional)</span></label>
              <input class="booking-input" type="tel" id="booking-phone" name="phone">
              <label class="booking-label" for="booking-notes">What's happening with a lead right now? <span class="booking-optional">(optional)</span></label>
              <textarea class="booking-input" id="booking-notes" name="notes" rows="3"></textarea>
              <button type="submit" class="btn ink" style="margin-top:16px;">Confirm the call</button>
              <p id="booking-status" class="disclaim" style="margin-top:10px;"></p>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="disclaim" style="margin-top:16px;">Prefer email? Write to <a href="mailto:hello@dealerflywheel.com" style="color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">hello@dealerflywheel.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <script src="/js/booking.js" defer></script>
      <div class="geo-light">
        <b>Where we work</b>
        <p>Nassau and Suffolk Counties first, on purpose. We'd rather be in your store than on a video call.</p>
        <b>Who we work with</b>
        <p>New-car franchised dealerships, single rooftops through five-store groups, with real BDC operations and real technology spend.</p>
        <b>Who buys</b>
        <p>Usually the dealer principal or GM. The GSM, BDC director and fixed ops director are the ones who feel the problem first.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
